SUMMARY:Lawn And Order: A Staged Reading Of A New Eco-Comedy by Elaine Alexander (Charlotte)
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy a brew and laugh at “Lawn And Order” –a wild new eco-comedy satirizing suburban America’s obsession with having the perfect lawn! \nREGISTER HERE
